# Dependencies & build output (reinstalled/rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.wrangler
# TypeScript incremental cache — stale copies make `tsc` skip emitting on a clean
# build (deploy-utils emitted 0 files → app-backend couldn't resolve its types).
**/*.tsbuildinfo
apps/runtime/worker/dist
apps/runtime/client/dist

# Python
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov

# Local data / artifacts / secrets. Mirror the secret-bearing .gitignore entries so
# `./run.sh local` state (live secrets, meta.sqlite operator hashes, per-app user
# DBs), mkcert TLS keys, and the Caddy DNS-01 token NEVER enter the build context or
# the builder-stage layer cache. A churning meta.sqlite-wal here would also bust the
# `COPY . .` layer on every build.
**/.env
**/.env.local
apps/agent/.local_artifacts
apps/agent/_vendor
data
exepad-data
.exepad-data
certs/
*.pem
caddy.env
.claude/
.playwright-mcp/

# VCS & tooling
.git
.github
**/*.log
**/test-results.json
**/coverage

# Docs & editor cruft not needed at build time
**/.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea
